#: firstrundlg.cpp:117 svedialog.cpp:150
msgid "Handbook"
msgstr "Handbook"

#: firstrundlg.cpp:129
msgid ""
"<p>SimpleViewer is a Flash component which is free to use, but uses a "
"license which comes into conflict with several distributions. Due to the "
"license it is not possible to ship it with this plugin.</p><p>You can now "
"download SimpleViewer from its homepage and point this tool to the "
"downloaded archive. The archive will be stored with the plugin "
"configuration, so it is available for further use.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>SimpleViewer is en free bruukbor Flash-Komponent, man mit en poor "
"Distributschonen gifft dat Lizenzproblemen. Wegen de Lizenz dröff dat nich "
"tosamen mit dissen Moduul utlevert warrn.</p><p>Du kannst SimpleViewer aver "
"vun de Projekt-Nettsiet daalladen un dissen Programm den Padd na't daallaadt "
"Archiv angeven. Dat Archiv warrt tosamen mit de Moduulinstellen sekert, so "
"dat sik dat ok later noch bruken lett.</p>"

#: firstrundlg.cpp:137
msgid "<p>1.) Download SimpleViewer Version 1.9.x</p>"
msgstr "<p>1.) SimpleViewer Verschoon 1.9.x daalladen</p>"

#: firstrundlg.cpp:147
msgid "<p>2.) Point this tool to the downloaded archive</p>"
msgstr "<p>2.) Giff den Padd na't daallaadt Archiv an</p>"

#: generalpage.cpp:82
msgid "Gallery &Title"
msgstr "Sammeln-&Titel"

#: generalpage.cpp:85
msgid "Enter here the gallery title"
msgstr "Hier bitte den Titel vun de Sammeln ingeven"

#: generalpage.cpp:93
msgid "Save Gallery To"
msgstr "Sammeln sekern na"

#: generalpage.cpp:104
msgid "Image Properties"
msgstr "Bildegenschappen"

#: generalpage.cpp:106
msgid "Resize Target Images"
msgstr "Teelbillergrött ännern"

#: generalpage.cpp:108
msgid "If you enable this option, all target images can be resized."
msgstr "Wenn Du dit anmaakst, kannst Du de Grött vun all Teelbiller ännern."

#: generalpage.cpp:112
msgid "Auto-Rotate/Flip Images"
msgstr "Biller automaatsch dreihen/spegeln"

#: generalpage.cpp:114
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, the images orientation will be fixed accordingly "
"with Exif information"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dit anmaakst, warrt de Bildutrichten na de EXIF-Informatschoon "
"fastsett"

#: generalpage.cpp:121
msgid "&Target Images Size:"
msgstr "&Teelbillergrött:"

#: generalpage.cpp:122
msgid ""
"The new size of the exported images in pixels. SimpleViewer resizes the "
"images as well, but this resizes your images before they are uploaded to "
"your server"
msgstr ""
"De niege Grött vun't exporteerte Bild in Pixels. SimpleViewer ännert twaars "
"ok de Bildgrött, man dit ännert de Grött vun de Biller, ehr se na den Server "
"hoochlaadt warrt."

#: generalpage.cpp:135
msgid "&Displayed Images Size:"
msgstr "Grött vun &wiest Biller:"

#: generalpage.cpp:136
msgid ""
"scales the displayed images to this size. Largest height or width of your "
"largest image (in pixels). Images will not be scaled up above this size, to "
"ensure best image quality."
msgstr ""
"Passt de wiest Biller na disse Grött to. Gröttst Hööchd oder Breed vun Dien "
"gröttst Bild (in Pixels). De Biller warrt nich grötter topasst as hier "
"angeven, so dat de Bildgööd wohrt blifft."

#: generalpage.cpp:151
msgid "Misc"
msgstr "Annerswat"

#: generalpage.cpp:154
msgid "Display Captions"
msgstr "Beschrieven wiesen"

#: generalpage.cpp:156
msgid "If you enable this option, the images caption will be shown"
msgstr "Wenn Du dit anmaakst, warrt de Bildbeschrieven wiest."

#: generalpage.cpp:159
msgid "Open Image with Right Click"
msgstr "Bild mit Rechtsklick opmaken"

#: generalpage.cpp:161
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, user will be able to open the target image in a "
"separate window using right mouse button"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dit anmaakst, kann de Bruker dat Teelbild mit de rechte Muustast in "
"en anner Finster opmaken."

#: generalpage.cpp:165
msgid "Open gallery in Konqueror"
msgstr "Sammeln in Konqueror opmaken"

#: generalpage.cpp:167
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, gallery will be open in Konqueror automatically"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Du dit anmaakst, warrt de Sammeln automaatsch in Konqueror opmaakt."

